IDGET&quot;'-eac835da9a4548b0END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">9c86c5aa-8020-483f-9d21-974ff4228128</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:9c86c5aa-8020-483f-9d21-974ff4228128\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:9c86c5aa-8020-483f-9d21-974ff4228128\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_UNI_WYR_GyldroMotherLetter</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:BOOK_UNI_WYR_GyldroMotherLetter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:BOOK_UNI_WYR_GyldroMotherLetter\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Rivington_General\" title=\"Rivington General\">The Rivington General</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-7&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-63</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>My dearest darling Gyldro,\n</p><p><br>\nYour last letter left me rather concerned. I think it's time you seek some professional counsel for your melanncholy. Such things can't be left to brew away unchecked. You've always been a sensitive soul, and I know how heartbreak has always hurt you more than you let on.  There's no shame in seeking a little aid, is there? I'm always here for you, you know that, but I'm not expert when it comes to these things, and I think you should find someone who is. I say this with all the love in the world. Please, at least think about it?\n</p><p><br>\nLove, always,\n</p><p>Mama\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714234323\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.039 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.040 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1359/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25342/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7112/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.008/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 935625/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   32.615      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   32.615      1 -total\n 51.25%   16.714      6 Template:Icon_text\n 44.77%   14.601     15 Template:Trim\n 22.37%    7.296      2 Template:Uid\n 15.72%    5.126      1 Template:Main_only\n 11.91%    3.885      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.78%    3.515      1 Template:Notes\n 10.18%    3.320      6 Template:Ifempty\n 10.08%    3.289      1 Template:Icon_link\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:31079-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714234323 and revision id 364848. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}